Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T8 Bot2.Upkeep]
? Stack = Gear test: opponent-discards-on-turn, turn 4
? Bot2.Hand.Count = 0
[T8 Bot2.Main1]

